{
  "_doc": "Rudder pedals (owner's 'Full rudder assem COMPLETE.STEP', 41 parts, Y up, mm). Parts are grouped by what moves together: each lever arm swings on its top pivot bolt and carries its pedal (sub, turns on the hinge bolt at the lever's foot for the toe brake), its rear rod-end bolt and its screws; the rods link the lever rears to the sensor lever (rocker, turns about x on the center bolt, carries the magnet holder). Walls and middle supports never move. Colors follow the owner's mechanism render (assets/motion/rudder-pedals-mechanism.mp4): charcoal side walls, light grey printed levers and supports, orange pedals; the actor sets roughness per color. Instance suffixes (-1..-9) were matched to positions with tools/cad.py inspect --json. The STEP stays in the scratchpad (not published). Detail pass: the two spring anchor screws (SHCS -6/-8) are skipped and drawn by the actor at a mid adjustment hole; the clevis pins (SHCS -5/-7) ride with their pedals; bearings and bolts are meshed coarse.",
  "name": "rudder-pedals",
  "out": "next/assets/3d/",
  "formats": [
    "cadmesh"
  ],
  "up": "y",
  "origin": "bottom",
  "quality": "medium",
  "unmatched": "keep",
  "order": [
    "wallR",
    "wallL",
    "core",
    "rocker",
    "rodR",
    "rodL",
    "leverR",
    "leverL"
  ],
  "parts": [
    {
      "match": [
        "*20CHX-6",
        "*20CHX-8"
      ],
      "skip": true,
      "note": "centering spring anchor screws: the actor draws them at the chosen adjustment hole (the CAD has them in the lowest hole)"
    },
    {
      "match": "Pedal RIGHT*",
      "name": "leverR",
      "sub": "pedalR",
      "color": "#e59f5c",
      "label": "Right pedal",
      "deflection": 0.25,
      "angle": 0.5
    },
    {
      "match": "Pedal left and right print",
      "name": "leverL",
      "sub": "pedalL",
      "color": "#e59f5c",
      "label": "Left pedal",
      "deflection": 0.25,
      "angle": 0.5
    },
    {
      "match": "*20CHX-7",
      "name": "leverR",
      "sub": "pedalR",
      "material": "darkMetal",
      "deflection": 1.5,
      "angle": 2.0,
      "note": "brake spring pin through the pedal's clevis (moves with the pedal)"
    },
    {
      "match": "LEVER ARM",
      "name": "leverR",
      "label": "Right lever arm",
      "color": "#c4c8ce",
      "deflection": 0.25,
      "angle": 0.5
    },
